&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; font-size: 8pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Years Ended December 31,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
